```text
RESOLUTION NO. __________
ENTITLED: "A RESOLUTION AMENDING THE CITY OF CHEYENNE 2023
PROGRAM YEAR ANNUAL ACTION PLAN, PREPARED BY THE
CHEYENNE HOUSING & COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT OFFICE."
WHEREAS, the Department of Housing and Urban Development (HUD) provides
funding to communities to address housing and urban development problems;
WHEREAS, the City of Cheyenne has been designated by HUD as an Entitlement
Community and is eligible to receive an annual allocation of CDBG (Community Development
Block Grant) funds based on the 2020-2024 Comprehensive Consolidated Plan which the
Governing Body adopted on October 12, 2020; and
WHEREAS, the 2023 Program Year Annual Action Plan has been amended in
compliance with the City's Citizen Participation Plan, which requires citizen input and two
public hearings including review and recommendations by the Housing and Community
Development Office Advisory Council.  A copy of the 2023 Amended Annual Action Plan is
attached to this resolution.
NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE
CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, that the amendments to the 2023 Program Year Annual
Action Plan are adopted and the Governing Body, Mayor, City Clerk are authorized to submit
the amended Plan, along with certificates, and execute all HUD contracts and third-party
agreements with operating and sponsoring agents necessary to implement and accomplish the
2023 Program Year Annual Action Plan.
PRESENTED, READ AND ADOPTED this _______ day of _____________________,
2024.
__________________________________________
Patrick Collins, Mayor
(SEAL)
ATTEST:
____________________________________
Kristina F. Jones, City Clerk
