low-income neighborhood
Actions planned to develop institutional structure
It is the responsibility of the Cheyenne Housing & Community Development (H&CD) Office Program
Manager to administer the 2023 grant proposals, as well as ongoing programs from prior years, as a
public guardian in a manner that is accountable and demonstrates cost effective methods for the
betterment of the community, while reflecting the intent of CDBG to service the needs of the
community in meeting a national objective.
The H&CD Office works with several City Departments on CDBG funded projects.  These department
include the following:
1) Finance Department, which provides management of the financial aspects of the grant and fund draw
